^{:go/end 248} (go/method typeParamIndex "typeParamIndex returns the index of the given type parameter within\nthe dictionary. This may differ from typ.Index() when there are\nimplicit or receiver type parameters.\n" ^int [^{:tag (* writerDict)} dict ^{:tag (* types2/TypeParam)} typ]
